&lt;p&gt;As a Corporate Communication Senior Manager focused on Executive Communications Programs, you will build and scale Datadog&#39;s integrated thought leadership program — spanning executive communications, earned and owned channels, and events — with a focus on extending it across priority regions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits at the intersection of strategy and execution: you&#39;ll translate leadership priorities into playbooks, frameworks, and measurable programs, then run them day to day. Success hinges on connecting dots across initiatives and partner teams to find new opportunities to tell Datadog&#39;s story through our executive voices.&lt;/p&gt;
