&lt;p&gt;Datadog is looking for a contract Enablement Designer for Recruiting and People to build and deliver the training content for our global team over a 12-month engagement. This is a hands-on build-and-facilitate role: you will design curriculum, produce content, and run live training for recruiters, sourcers, coordinators, and people leaders across our global sites.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This engagement is scoped around content, design, and delivery. Overall program ownership, roadmap, and long-term governance sit with Recruiting Operations leadership, who you will report to and partner with closely. Your job is to build the material and get it into people’s hands — and to leave behind a documented, maintainable system when the engagement ends.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Datadog, we place value in our office culture - the relationships and collaboration it builds and the creativity it brings to the table. We operate as a hybrid workplace to ensure our Datadogs can create a work-life harmony that best fits them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design and build modular enablement content across the recruiting lifecycle:&lt;/strong&gt; intake, sourcing, assessment, closing, candidate experience, systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Produce it to a publishable standard:&lt;/strong&gt; facilitator guides, participant materials, job aids, async modules, knowledge checks, and the LMS and SCORM packaging that gets them live.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Facilitate the core curriculum &lt;/strong&gt;on an agreed cadence, including regional delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the measurement layer:&lt;/strong&gt; completion, confidence, and manager-reported readiness against a baseline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribute the AI layer&lt;/strong&gt; into existing manager development rather than building a parallel leader track.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leave a maintainable content model:&lt;/strong&gt; source files, owners, review cadence, update triggers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in Talent Acquisition, Enablement, Learning &amp;amp; Development, or instructional design, with meaningful time inside or directly supporting a recruiting function&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A prolific content builder — you can point to curricula, playbooks, and training materials you personally designed and shipped&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A confident facilitator who can hold a room of experienced recruiters, in person and virtually&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fast to ramp and comfortable operating with limited hand-holding; you can walk into a new organization, diagnose the gaps, and start producing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced working as a contractor or consultant, with a track record of scoped delivery against a timeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled at building credibility quickly with stakeholders you do not manage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable designing for a global audience across the Americas, EMEA, and APAC&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced developing or coaching people leaders is a strong plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What This Role Is Not:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ownership of the overall Recruiting Enablement program, roadmap, or budget — that remains with Recruiting Operations leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;People management or headcount ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ongoing operational support for recruiting systems or processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Datadog values people from all walks of life. We understand not everyone will meet all the above qualifications on day one. That&#39;s okay. If you’re passionate about technology and want to grow your skills, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
