&lt;li&gt;Lead a core team of 5 engineers (distributed, with majority in NYC)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead ceremonies, prioritize and delegate project&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay hands-on with the code, e.g. isolated features, small remediations, investigation follow ups&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay actively involved in operations, incidents, root cause analysis, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Constantly promote a culture of operational excellence, organizing gamedays, conducting operational reviews, staying proactive with reliability&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
