&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are: &lt;/strong&gt;(Describe role qualifications here/max 6 bullets)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong distributed systems skills, able to understand and account for a variety of failure modes, well-versed in end-to-end o11y, validation testing, simulation setup, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Worked on platform teams before, providing critical infrastructure to internal stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced in handling significant incidents, both as a responder and follow-up owner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cross-team collaboration and stakeholder management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong foundation in coding, experienced with performance optimizations and profiling&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
