&lt;p&gt;We are Datadog&#39;s in-house product experts. The Technical Solutions team enables Datadog&#39;s worldwide growth by educating potential clients and ensuring that existing customers are happy and successful. We share our technical and product expertise with customers via multi-channel technical support, demos, and presentations. You’ll be joining a team and company where you will be challenged, but also will immediately witness your contributions to Datadog.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Datadog, we place value in our office culture - the relationships and collaboration it builds and the creativity it brings to the table. We operate as a hybrid workplace to ensure our Datadogs can create a work-life harmony that best fits them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage, develop, coach and mentor a team of Premier Support Engineers who respond to client requests, reproduce and troubleshoot issues, and dive into Datadog’s 600+ integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the owner for your team’s accountability and performance - partnering closely with upper management to facilitate performance reviews, performance plans, and any employee relations issues for your direct reports&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure successful training and onboarding of new hires&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide the team through technical-training, certificates and additional learning and development needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build out documentation and knowledge base articles for a variety of technologies&lt;/li&gt;
