&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;662&quot;&gt;Any information you submit to Datadog as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Datadog’s&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/applicant-candidate-privacy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/applicant-candidate-privacy/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Applicant and Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. For information on our AI policy, please visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/interviewing-at-datadog-ai-guidelines/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Interviewing at Datadog AI Guidelines&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;165&quot; data-local-id=&quot;2f966ef1a368&quot;&gt;As a Product Manager - Code Intelligence , you will define, build, and launch capabilities that proactively detect infrastructure issues in code (e.g. Terraform, Helm) and recommend changes before they can be deployed into production and escalate into production incidents. The Infrastructure Monitoring team has pioneered shift-left detection in the industry with &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/blog/bits-infrastructure-operations/&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Bits Infrastructure Operations&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, and we’re looking for a Product Manager to expand this capability to a broader set of use cases.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;661&quot; data-local-id=&quot;08b6f55c7cc3&quot;&gt;Customers (and thus developers) are increasingly standardizing on IaC tools to deploy and maintain ever-growing infrastructure in the cloud. At the same time, SREs and Infra teams struggle with an increasing number of production incidents. By shifting-left and building agentic capabilities in the dev workflow, we can identify high-impact infra changes before they are deployed, help reduce production incidents, reduce waste, and free up SRE time to focus on value-added tasks. You will own the roadmap to expand these agentic capabilities to a broader set of use cases, including cost detection, blast radius impact, as well as configuration changes on infrastructure powering applications like nginx, postgres and more. You’ll partner closely with Engineering, Design, and customers to build and iterate on the roadmap, build product market fit, drive customer adoption (including internal usage), and focus on coverage and correctness of the AI system. This is an opportunity to lead an initiative at the intersection of AI, infrastructure operations, and autonomous observability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1749&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4937edb02671&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;At Datadog, we place value in our office culture - the relationships and collaboration it builds and the creativity it brings to the table. We operate as a hybrid workplace to ensure our Datadogs can create a work-life harmony that best fits them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b55044f251eb&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2017&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8f57ecc074b6&quot;&gt;Lead the product roadmap for Code Intelligence, enabling customers to proactively detect high-impact infrastructure and configuration changes and recommend changes before they are deployed into production and escalate into incidents.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2255&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3dd48c492395&quot;&gt;Define the end-to-end agentic experience across the Datadog UI, developer workflows (e.g. GitHub). Partner with Design and Engineering to create user-facing experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2428&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1e2003878d2c&quot;&gt;Work with customers, including Datadog, to drive adoption and iterate the product&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2513&quot; data-local-id=&quot;825c0e149fae&quot;&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally with infrastructure monitoring, AI product teams, and other teams in Datadog to integrate IaC detection capabilities across the Datadog platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2693&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3afe4840893d&quot;&gt;Establish quality standards and success metrics, including coverage, correctness, and user trust.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
