&lt;li&gt;Prioritisation and organisational skills: scheduling, fixing, calendar management, handling urgent requests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sense of urgency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accuracy and the highest attention to detail in daily tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tooling fluency (Goodtime and Greenhouse previous knowledge is preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear and concise written communication with candidates, interviewers and stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team spirit: being able to work autonomously but also within a group with a team player attitude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reliability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI expectations: Appetite and daily use of approved tools to automate routine tasks, focusing on efficiency and consistency in your daily workflow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&quot;Can-do&quot; attitude: ready to take on any challenge and give each candidate a top-notch experience&lt;/li&gt;
