&lt;p&gt;Working closely with global and regional teams, you will ensure a consistent brand experience across product messaging, campaigns, events, and digital channels, helping deliver Datadog’s value to the LATAM markets in a clear and compelling way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Datadog, we place value in our office culture - the relationships and collaboration it builds and the creativity it brings to the table. We operate as a hybrid workplace to ensure our Datadogs can create a work-life harmony that best fits them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute content strategies tailored to LATAM markets including campaigns, ABM programs, product launches, customer stories, events, and PR initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and adapt localized storytelling and messaging based on global marketing assets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage high-quality content creation in collaboration with global teams and external partners (translation vendors, writers, creative agencies, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage content publishing across multiple channels — website, social media, blogs, email, and event materials&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide market insights and feedback to global teams to inform global marketing strategies and initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure brand consistency across tone, voice, and messaging in all LATAM marketing assets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee localization projects including planning, timelines, quality, and cost management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measure and optimize content performance, including lead generation, engagement, and ROI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Native-level fluency in Portuguese and professional fluency in English and Spanish.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keen interest in and practical experience using AI-powered content creation tools (such as generative AI platforms for writing, editing, ideation, or multimedia content), with the ability to apply these tools to improve quality, efficiency, and creativity in role-relevant work.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of hands-on experience in marketing or content development, preferably in the B2B, IT, or SaaS industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience adapting global marketing messages for LATAM markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience planning and executing digital marketing campaigns across web, blog, social media, and email&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of the LATAM markets, technology landscape, and customer behavior&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience or understanding of translation and localization processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skills in content creation, including copywriting, editing, or conducting interviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge or experience with ABM (Account-Based Marketing) or digital marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in product marketing within the SaaS or cloud industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
