&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Microsoft Excel required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently, with a strong work ethic, self-motivation and problem-solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attention to detail and high level of accuracy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, both written and verbal; position is highly visible in the company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Salesforce, NetSuite and Tableau a plus&lt;/li&gt;
