&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;css-v55p23&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Support negotiation processes, including term sheets and partnership structures.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;css-v55p23&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaborate on integration planning with cross-functional partners after acquisitions or strategic deals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
