&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;css-v55p23&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent prioritization and ability to operate across multiple complex stakeholders and projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;css-v55p23&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong communication skills and enthusiasm for developing negotiation capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
