&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2147&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d901a933c063&quot;&gt;5+ years of professional software engineering experience, with hands-on coding ability across the stack you&#39;re deployed into&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2275&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5f6dceff17f5&quot;&gt;Experience with feature flagging, experimentation, or config management systems (internal or vendor)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2379&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4a94683be1d1&quot;&gt;Comfortable dropping into unfamiliar codebases, languages, and frameworks quickly - no specific stack required, but strong fundamentals and fast ramp-up&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2535&quot; data-local-id=&quot;855940805fd6&quot;&gt;Experience shipping production code, not just prototypes;&amp;nbsp; you understand the difference between a demo and something that survives a migration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2682&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1efca038f517&quot;&gt;Customer-facing experience, or strong motivation to build it; comfortable being in the room with customer engineers, understanding their constraints, and adapting your approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2862&quot; data-local-id=&quot;67e23e7ece55&quot;&gt;Ability to travel up to 20% of the time to customer sites&lt;/li&gt;
