&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;662&quot;&gt;Any information you submit to Datadog as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Datadog’s&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/applicant-candidate-privacy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/applicant-candidate-privacy/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Applicant and Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. For information on our AI policy, please visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/interviewing-at-datadog-ai-guidelines/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Interviewing at Datadog AI Guidelines&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a Senior Analyst, Procurement Operations to manage vendor onboarding and improve the systems and workflows that support the purchasing lifecycle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will guide vendors and internal stakeholders through onboarding requirements, coordinate reviews and approvals, maintain accurate data, and resolve issues that delay requests. You will also help improve Zip and related systems by identifying process gaps, documenting requirements, testing changes, and supporting automation and reporting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for someone with strong operational judgment, a systems mindset, and the ability to manage a high volume of requests in an evolving environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage vendor onboarding requests from submission through completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review submissions for completeness, accuracy, and required documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate reviews, approvals, and follow-ups with Privacy, GRC, IT, Internal Audit, Legal, Finance, and other teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help vendors and employees understand requirements, complete outstanding tasks, and resolve system issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate vendor records, approvals, contracts, documents, and audit trails across Zip and connected systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor request volumes, aging, and cycle times, prioritizing urgent requests and escalating blockers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a subject matter expert for Zip and related procurement systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate policies and business needs into clear requirements for workflows, routing, approvals, notifications, reporting, and exceptions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Test system changes, document results, report defects, and support releases through training and communications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to improve P2P processes through data, AI, and automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in procure-to-pay, vendor management, finance, or purchasing operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing vendor onboarding or vendor lifecycle processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with platforms such as Zip, Coupa, Oracle, NetSuite, DocuSign, Brex, Ramp, or similar tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of how vendor data, purchasing requests, contracts, purchase orders, invoices, approvals, and payments connect.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience maintaining accurate system data and resolving incomplete, inconsistent, or duplicate records.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to document business requirements, test system changes, and work with technical teams to resolve issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sound judgment when applying policies, managing exceptions, and escalating risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An analytical mindset and interest in using data, AI, and automation to improve processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication, organization, and prioritization skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A bachelor’s degree or equivalent practical experience is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: white;&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Datadog offers a competitive salary and equity package, and may include variable compensation. Actual compensation is based on factors such as the candidate&#39;s skills, qualifications, and experience. In addition, Datadog offers a wide range of best in class, comprehensive and inclusive employee benefits for this role including healthcare, dental, parental planning, and mental health benefits, a 401(k) plan and match, paid time off, fitness reimbursements, and a discounted employee stock purchase plan.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The reasonably estimated yearly salary for this role at Datadog is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$89,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$118,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Datadog:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog is the leading observability and security platform for the AI era, providing businesses with unified visibility across the technology stack to manage complexity at scale. It brings applications, infrastructure, data, models, and security into one place, using AI to detect and resolve issues before they impact customers. Trusted globally by Fortune 500 companies and high-growth AI leaders, Datadog enables businesses to move faster with clarity and confidence. Learn more about #DatadogLife on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/datadoghq/?hl=en&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/datadog&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn,&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://learn.datadoghq.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Datadog Learning Center. &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
