&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with org leaders across the region to strategically plan for hiring across multiple business orgs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop strategies to build and fill active and passive talent pipelines in order to tackle roles of varying complexity, while hiring at a high volume&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop ideas to pivot messaging, job descriptions, or any external facing content/events to help impact our ability to acquire talent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay on top of the latest recruiting strategies, market movements, and company changes&lt;/li&gt;
