&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3520&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3b0ab4a6f878&quot;&gt;Experience analyzing incidents, identifying systemic risks, and driving engineering improvements informed by operational learnings.&lt;/p&gt;
