&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3655&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7cfd5bca5af9&quot;&gt;Experience participating in on-call rotations and improving incident response processes. Experience serving as an incident commander or incident coordinator is a plus.&lt;/p&gt;
