&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3826&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7435fbb32950&quot;&gt;Empathy, collaboration, and communication skills in English to cultivate strong relationships across various teams in the organization&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3964&quot; data-local-id=&quot;092abcd8f924&quot;&gt;Experience mentoring engineers, driving cross-functional initiatives, and influencing technical direction without relying on organizational authority.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4118&quot; data-local-id=&quot;76ffc6d0adb3&quot;&gt;We welcome candidates from a variety of backgrounds, including software engineering, site reliability engineering, production engineering, infrastructure, and other roles focused on building reliable systems or improving incident response.&lt;/p&gt;
