&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2336&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1753ffbf88ab&quot;&gt;You can develop several different directions, synthesize the strongest ideas, and explain why one should move forward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2458&quot; data-local-id=&quot;deaf8ce32a21&quot;&gt;Your craft is top-shelf and know how to create the thing in your head.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2532&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f6477f0eb4dd&quot;&gt;You understand how typography, color, composition, imagery, iconography, and motion work together to create a coherent visual language.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2671&quot; data-local-id=&quot;2a8d1a76e3cb&quot;&gt;You can move a room, executives included, with a story and a compelling artifact.&lt;/p&gt;
