&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3866&quot;&gt;Bias toward implementing solutions and driving adoption, not just surfacing findings&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3954&quot;&gt;Proven track record of winning buy-in from technical and non-technical stakeholders; able to communicate complex tradeoffs clearly to engineers, product managers, and leadership&lt;/p&gt;
