&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain product, pricing, solutions, careers, about, and other pages across Datadog’s web properties, partnering with Engineering to support CMS templates, components, permissions, and workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Content, Product Marketing, and UX to prioritize web work, structure content for the web, and ensure requests have the scope and lead time needed for high-quality execution&lt;/li&gt;
