&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced building and maintaining web pages in a modern CMS such as DatoCMS, Contentful, Adobe Experience Manager, or a similar platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong in technical SEO and AI discoverability fundamentals, including structured data, headings, internal linking, crawlability, and how AI answer engines interpret web content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable using platforms such as Conductor, Profound, or similar tools to measure discoverability and inform web decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to take content created for other formats and structure it into clear, effective web experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced using AI, agents, automation, or reusable workflows to reduce repetitive work and improve operational efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organized across requests from multiple teams and able to plan and prioritize work while maintaining quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Datadog values people from all walks of life. We understand not everyone will meet all the above qualifications on day one. That&#39;s okay. If you’re passionate about technology and want to grow your skills, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
